316-
317-- Prompt Chaining / Planning -> base prompts; keep staged dependency, checkpoint, and fallback visibility explicit instead of collapsing into one-shot execution language
318-- Routing / Prioritization / Exploration -> `PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay`; prefer `Resource budget and route-choice memo` or `Prioritization queue / next-action memo`
319:- Parallelization / Multi-Agent / A2A -> `PROMPT_multi_agent_overlay` + `orchestration-control`; prefer `Delegation admission memo`, `A2A task-handoff memo`, and `Join-quality review memo`
320-- Tool Use / MCP -> `PROMPT_tool_protocol_overlay`; prefer `Tool capability contract / precondition memo` or `MCP capability handoff memo`
321-- Memory / Learning / Adaptation -> `PROMPT_memory_adaptation_overlay`; prefer `Memory scope / checkpoint profile memo`, `Learning-signal review memo`, and `Adaptation decision memo`
322-- Goal / Monitoring / Recovery / HITL -> base prompts; prefer `Goal-monitoring status memo`, `Recovery / escalation checkpoint memo`, and `HITL approval packet`
